# What tests\window-panel-clicks.input clicks, asked for by actions at the same frames (scripts\verify\panel.ps1, part
# clicks), live:
#   RayTracingViewer cornell -w 1280 --height 720 -s 32 --input tests\window-panel-asked.input --record r.txt
at 0 action panel on
at 20 action scene checker
at 55 action sampling material
at 85 action tonemap agx
at 110 action exposure 0.5
at 120 action exposure 1
at 140 action samples 64
at 260 action save
at 280 quit
